THE SCHOOL CHRONICLES

ULTIMATE MASTER GAME DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — V7.0

PROJECT VISION

Build a complete, high-quality, third-person 3D open-world school-life RPG named THE SCHOOL CHRONICLES.

This must be a real playable 3D game, not a normal website that only looks like a game.

The player should experience a living academy and a large surrounding world populated by hundreds of unique characters, AI-controlled NPCs, meaningful stories, dynamic events, friendships, rivalries, examinations, missions and continuous progression.

The world must evolve according to the player's actions and the history of previous stories.

The game must support mobile and desktop gameplay.

Use the existing project and preserve all working features. Extend the current implementation instead of unnecessarily rebuilding everything.

