Generation pipeline

1. Retrieve saved progression.
2. Retrieve relevant story history.
3. Retrieve NPC and relationship context.
4. Generate a new story outline.
5. Generate sequential phases.
6. Generate objectives and missions.
7. Validate continuity.
8. Validate character references.
9. Validate age-appropriateness.
10. Validate phase dependencies.
11. Generate cover-image prompts.
12. Save approved content.
13. Display the story in the library.

