FINAL EXPERIENCE

The School Chronicles must feel like a continuously evolving 3D world.

The player creates a character, enters the academy, selects stories, completes phases, attends classes, explores the world and develops relationships.

There are exactly four academy classes: A, B, C and D.

Each class contains main characters, supporting characters and a large population of normal NPCs.

NPCs are AI-controlled characters with personalities, independent decisions, memories, goals, schedules, relationships and interactions with other NPCs.

The player should not be the only character whose life progresses. The world must feel alive even when the player is exploring somewhere else.

The Gemini AI Story Director must use previous stories, player choices, NPC memories and world history to generate new connected stories and phases.

When all existing stories are complete, the world should continue expanding through new AI-generated adventures.

FINAL GOAL: A persistent, intelligent, large-scale 3D open-world school RPG with autonomous AI NPCs, meaningful stories, continuous character development and an expandable living world.